meta {
  name: 13 Hoeren runs 20 minutes, not 30
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/exam-sessions/{{b2ExamSessionId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.level: eq B2
}

docs {
  The number this phase exists to get right. telc runs B2 Hoerverstehen for
  about 20 minutes against B1's 30, and it is the ONLY value that differs
  between the two levels: Lesen+Sprachbausteine 90 and Schreiben 30 are the
  same, and so is every point in the grid.

  The schedule is read from exam_block_durations by the sitting's level, so
  confirm it where a candidate sees it — start the sitting as a participant
  and check the Hoeren block's minutes, or read the rows directly:

    npm run modelltest:verify -- --level B2 --number 7

  With no B2 rows at all this is 404 EXAM_TIMINGS_MISSING rather than a wrong
  number, which is the better failure of the two.
}
